{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03984","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 韩仲宣","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲知行有乐，芳尊对物华。\n地接安仁县，园是季伦家。\n柳处云疑叶，梅间雪似花。\n日落归途远，留兴伴烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩仲宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}